  "title": "Proficient Auto Logistics Announces Participation in William Blair Growth Stock Conference; Sets Date to Report Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "JACKSONVILLE, Fla., June 01, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Proficient Auto Logistics, Inc. (Nasdaq: PAL) (the “Company”) today announced that Rick O’Dell, Chairman and Chief Executive Officer, and Brad Wright, Chief Financial Officer will attend the William Blair Growth Stock Conference on June 2, 2026.",
